DESC:The Advanced Bestiary collects over 100 monster templates for the Pathfinder Roleplaying Game, from elemental and energy templates to celestial and fiendish possession, undead lineages, construct conversions and size-shifting transformations. Every template can be layered onto an existing creature, letting a GM build a new monster out of one already at hand.
